IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PERF.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-I PIC 9(3).
01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(3) VALUE 3.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5
        ADD WS-I TO WS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM.
    DISPLAY WS-TOTAL.
    PERFORM ADD-TWO WS-COUNT TIMES.
    DISPLAY WS-TOTAL.
    PERFORM COUNT-DOWN UNTIL WS-COUNT = 0.
    DISPLAY WS-COUNT.
    PERFORM ONCE.
    PERFORM ONCE.
    DISPLAY WS-TOTAL.
    STOP RUN.
ADD-TWO.
    ADD 2 TO WS-TOTAL.
COUNT-DOWN.
    SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-COUNT.
ONCE.
    ADD 10 TO WS-TOTAL.
